   "cues": [
    "sub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "hero-03",
   "scene": "hero",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Almost all of them are fixed. So learn each one with its last vowel.",
   "pause": 0.6,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-title-01",
   "scene": "c01-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Part one. Question isms. This is the table to learn.",
   "pause": 0.4,
   "cues": [
    "title"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-title-02",
   "scene": "c01-title",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "These question words are isms. Each one asks for one kind of answer.",
   "pause": 0.5,
   "cues": [
    "sub"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-table-01",
   "scene": "c01-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Each row has the word, its meaning, a question, and an answer.",
   "pause": 0.3,
   "cues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-table-02",
   "scene": "c01-table",
   "lang": "ar",
   "text": "مَنْ",
   "pause": 0.35,
   "cues": [
    "row:1",
    "cell:1.1"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "c01-table-03",
   "scene": "c01-table",
   "lang": "en",
   "text": "Who. It asks for a person.",
